      ],
      "id": "wfb-respond-017",
      "name": "Respond"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-Batch — Generate Batch (fb-generate-batch)\\nOn-demand only. The Dashboard 'Generate up to N' button (executive-gated, N capped at MAX_PER_GENERATION) POSTs { max } with the `x-webhook-secret: __N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET__` header.\\n\\nSelect Slots picks up to `max` fb_content_plan rows (status='planned', plan_date>=today, no fb_posts row for that date), oldest first, and pre-builds each slot's generator prompt (all reads via this.helpers.httpRequest — no fan-out). Loop Over Slots then runs WF1's generation per slot (Anthropic → image prompt → image → decode → upload → public URL → insert fb_posts draft → mark plan row 'generated' → bump subtopic), with a ~3s throttle between slots and a hard cap at `max`. One GroupMe summary at the end (Execute Once).\\n\\nReplace `YOUR_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` and `__...__` placeholders on import. Keep `active:false` in the committed copy.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "wfb-note-00018",
      "name": "About WF-Batch"
    }
  ],
